{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Which</b> — He mentioned the second vision, for it is the principal vision concerning the Jews who remained in the land of the north, Babylon and Persia." "<b>And the white ones go out after them</b> — And he did not concern himself to identify the land to which they went out there." "<b>And the dappled ones</b> — They are the fourth chariot." "<b>Go out</b> — To the south, the opposite of the second chariot, which went out to the land of the north."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:08.420553776Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}